## Disaster Recovery

### Backup Strategy
- **Redis:** RDB snapshots every 15 minutes
- **TimescaleDB:** pg_dump daily, WAL archiving
- **Configuration:** Version controlled in Git

### Recovery Procedures
```bash
# Redis recovery
redis-cli --rdb /path/to/backup.rdb

# TimescaleDB recovery
pg_restore -h localhost -U titan -d titan_betting backup.dump
```

## Common Issues & Solutions

### Issue: Docker services not starting
```powershell
# Check Docker Desktop is running
docker info

# Force recreate
docker-compose -f docker/docker-compose.yml down -v
docker-compose -f docker/docker-compose.yml up -d
```

### Issue: Backend can't connect to Redis
```powershell
# Test Redis connection
docker exec titan_redis redis-cli ping

# Check environment variables
$env:REDIS_HOST
$env:REDIS_PORT
```

### Issue: Scraper browser crashes
```powershell
# Clear browser cache
Remove-Item -Recurse ~/.cache/ms-playwright

# Reinstall browsers
playwright install chromium
```

## CI/CD Pipeline (Recommended)
```yaml
# .github/workflows/test.yml
name: Tests
on: [push, pull_request]
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    services:
      redis:
        image: redis:7-alpine
        ports: ["6379:6379"]
      postgres:
        image: timescale/timescaledb:latest-pg15
        ports: ["5432:5432"]
        env:
          POSTGRES_DB: titan_test
          POSTGRES_PASSWORD: test
    steps:
      - uses: actions/checkout@v3
      - name: Run backend tests
        run: pytest tests/ -v
      - name: Run frontend tests
        run: cd frontend && npm test
```

